# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
debug
target

# Selected MCP target tests are Rust source, so Cargo output rules must not hide their module directory.
# 已选 MCP 目标测试是 Rust 源码，因此 Cargo 产物规则不得隐藏其模块目录。
!/crates/vulcan-agent-runtime/src/mcp/runtime/handle/candidate/target/
!/crates/vulcan-agent-runtime/src/mcp/runtime/handle/candidate/target/*.rs

# These are backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk

# MSVC Windows builds of rustc generate these, which store debugging information
*.pdb

# Generated by cargo mutants
# Contains mutation testing data
**/mutants.out*/

# RustRover
#  JetBrains specific template is maintained in a separate JetBrains.gitignore that can
#  be found at https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Global/JetBrains.gitignore
#  and can be added to the global gitignore or merged into this file.  For a more nuclear
#  option (not recommended) you can uncomment the following to ignore the entire idea folder.
#.idea/


# Added by cargo

/target
/third_party
/.qwen
/.claude
/.vulcan/
/output
/temp

# Documentation stays local by default: plans, audits, reviews, and drafts are not shipped.
# 文档默认仅保留在本地：计划、审计、评审与草稿都不随仓库分发。
# Only docs/contracts/ ships: those are the documents AGENTS.md requires every session to read.
# 只有 docs/contracts/ 随仓库分发：那里放的是 AGENTS.md 要求所有会话必读的文档。
**/docs/*
!/docs/contracts/
.codex_tmp*

# Local task board state.
# 本地任务看板状态。
/TASK_*.md

# Generated Node dependencies, including nested test caches and prepared browser payloads.
# 生成的 Node 依赖，包括嵌套测试缓存与准备好的浏览器依赖载荷。
**/node_modules/

# Generated WebUI build outputs.
# WebUI 生成的构建产物。
/apps/vulcan-code-web/dist/
/apps/vulcan-code-web/.vite/
/apps/vulcan-code-web/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo

# Generated Electron desktop build outputs.
# Electron 桌面端生成的构建产物。
/apps/vulcan-code-desktop/dist/
/apps/vulcan-code-desktop/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo

# Generated Tauri capability schemas for the service host.
# 服务宿主生成的 Tauri 能力架构文件。
/apps/vulcan-code-service/gen/

# Local Reasonix runtime state.
# 本地 Reasonix 运行时状态。
/.reasonix/

# Vendored protoc provisioned by make init-system; required by lance-encoding via lancedb.
# 由 make init-system 取得的随仓库 protoc；lancedb 经 lance-encoding 需要它。
.cargo/protoc/

# Local Claude Code session state (launch configs, settings).
# 本地 Claude Code 会话状态（启动配置、设置）。
/.claude/
